From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NXP-MR <meta-nxp-mr@nxp.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 15:54:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] libipa: camera_sensor_helper: Extend imx708 to imx708_wide

The imx708 camera sensor helper was added in
6a393789f342fb43e37d986394eb1848f9ca5093, but the Raspberry Pi specific
"wide" / "noir" suffixes were intentionally omitted, and the camera
sensor properties database has no entry for them either.

The NXP MR NAVQ95 board ships the Raspberry Pi Camera Module 3 Wide,
whose sensor reports the model string "imx708_wide". Without a matching
helper, libcamera fails to resolve the sensor and falls back with a
warning, degrading AE/AGC behaviour.

Register an "imx708_wide" helper that subclasses CameraSensorHelperImx708
so it inherits the exact black level and analogue gain formula from the
base imx708 helper.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [RPi-specific sensor model suffix, omitted
upstream by design in 6a393789f342fb43e37d986394eb1848f9ca5093]

Signed-off-by: NXP-MR <meta-nxp-mr@nxp.com>
---
 src/ipa/libipa/camera_sensor_helper.cpp | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/ipa/libipa/camera_sensor_helper.cpp b/src/ipa/libipa/camera_sensor_helper.cpp
index e3e3e5355..f00000000 100644
--- a/src/ipa/libipa/camera_sensor_helper.cpp
+++ b/src/ipa/libipa/camera_sensor_helper.cpp
@@ -653,6 +653,11 @@ public:
 };
 REGISTER_CAMERA_SENSOR_HELPER("imx708", CameraSensorHelperImx708)
 
+class CameraSensorHelperImx708Wide : public CameraSensorHelperImx708
+{
+};
+REGISTER_CAMERA_SENSOR_HELPER("imx708_wide", CameraSensorHelperImx708Wide)
+
 class CameraSensorHelperOv2685 : public CameraSensorHelper
 {
 public:
-- 
